{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Reine Audu (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the fruit seller <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reine_Audu\" title=\"Reine Audu\">Reine Audu</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> was jailed after the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Women's_March_on_Versailles\" title=\"Women's March on Versailles\">march on Versailles in 1789</a> for announcing her intention to \"[bring] back the Queen's head on her sword\", among other charges?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reine_Audu","retrieved":1784013787540},{"title":"an abandoned château in an advanced state of ruin (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Château_de_Logempré\" title=\"Château de Logempré\">an abandoned château in an advanced state of ruin</a></b> was saved with €500,000 from a lottery?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C3%A2teau_de_Logempr%C3%A9","retrieved":1784013787541},{"title":"stole a painting (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that in 1976, thieves tied up an art collector, <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Villiers-le-Bel_series#Exhibitions\" title=\"Villiers-le-Bel series\">stole a painting</a></b>, and were never caught?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Villiers-le-Bel_series#Exhibitions","retrieved":1784054147408},{"title":"Petite-Émigrée (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that mothers believed that taking young children to the grave of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Françoise_Gandriau\" title=\"Françoise Gandriau\"><span title=\"French-language text\"><i lang=\"fr\">Petite-Émigrée</i></span></a></b> would help them to walk early?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fran%C3%A7oise_Gandriau","retrieved":1784013787547},{"title":"a French company (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astier_de_Villatte\" title=\"Astier de Villatte\">a French company</a></b> revived a favorite perfume of the ancient Roman nobility in 2023?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astier_de_Villatte","retrieved":1784013787547},{"title":"a two-metre-high (6 ft 5 in) wall of dry stone (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mur_de_la_peste\" title=\"Mur de la peste\">a two-metre-high (6<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>ft 5<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>in) wall of dry stone</a></b> was built in 1721 to stop the advance of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Plague_of_Marseille\" title=\"Great Plague of Marseille\">Great Plague of Marseille</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mur_de_la_peste","retrieved":1784013787550},{"title":"Pierre Noël Lecauchois (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_Noël_Lecauchois\" title=\"Pierre Noël Lecauchois\">Pierre Noël Lecauchois</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> client was almost burned at the stake because the order to stay her execution was delayed?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_No%C3%ABl_Lecauchois","retrieved":1784013787551},{"title":"chicken in a pot (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Good King Henry allegedly said that he wanted every farmer to have a <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poule_au_pot\" title=\"Poule au pot\">chicken in a pot</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poule_au_pot","retrieved":1784013787552},{"title":"Pierre-Amable de Soubrany (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the corpse of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre-Amable_de_Soubrany\" title=\"Pierre-Amable de Soubrany\">Pierre-Amable de Soubrany</a></b> was <a rel=\"mw: